# secrets
Secrets: do not store secrets in code, use .env file and enforce reading the files

# code convetions
Python files, variables, functions: snake_case
Python classes: PascalCase
SQL files, tables, views, columns, databases, schemas: snake_case
Constants: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
Cloud Resources: kebab-case
Cloud Storage folder path/ Time based/ Category Region: kebab-case; Example: /[source_system]/[entity]/[partitioning_logic]/[file_name]
/[source_system]/[entity]/year=[YYYY]/month=[MM]/day=[DD]/hour=[HH]/minute=[mm]/second=[ss]/[file].parquet
Git Repositories: kebab-case
Cloud Tags: PascalCase

# branching strategy
use .gitignore and do not add secrets, .env files and temporary files
drafts, challenges & test: direct promotion
development (data): Environment Branching, GitHubFlow ( no releases ), Indirect promotion
production (data): Environment Branching, GitHubFlow ( no releases ), Indirect promotion

